## What is NOT upstream

Brand identity only: `brand/net4sats.json` (a descriptor), `brand/assets/*.png`
(logos), and `brand/active` (which descriptor is the default). These are inputs
to upstream's own brand slot — no rendering logic, no code diff, no vendor name
in the upstream tree.

